    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111819" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόγ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				69
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆξις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>burning heat, inflammation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.853
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				2.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>warming, heating,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαλανείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					4.61c
				</span></i>
			 (pl.).</div>
